  "prefLabel": "He-A 903.04 Program Audit",
  "priorExpiration": "2008-01-09",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-A 903.04 Program Audit. If providers want the department to review the appropriateness of the existing fee structure, those providers shall submit to the department audits of their records which are prepared by a public accounting firm within the current year.\n\nSource. #5252, eff 10-22-91, EXPIRED: 10-22-97\n\nNew. #7058, eff 7-21-99; ss by #8902, INTERIM, eff 7-13-07, EXPIRED: 1-9-08\n\nNew. #9082, eff 1-30-08 (from He-A 903.06)",
